canvas 460 280
label "Canonicalization: the same four inputs (content tree, configuration, build instant, git log) built on machine A and on machine B give identical bytes (highlighted), through NFC normalisation, fixed sort orders, canonical JSON and SHA-256"
caption "The highlighted result is the promise: build anywhere, get the same bytes, so a digest in the discovery document is a real integrity check."
box in 16 30 150 90 "four inputs|content tree|config file|build instant + git log"
box ma 210 30 110 50 "machine A"
box mb 210 90 110 50 "machine B"
box out 360 30 84 110 "identical|bytes" acc
arrow in ma
arrow in mb
arrow ma out
arrow mb out
box steps 16 150 428 60 "NFC first → fixed sort orders → JCS JSON|→ SHA-256, lowercase hex"
note "the promise: build it anywhere, get the same bytes — so a digest is a real check"
